  "claimBoundary": "text-free finite-menu interface, fail-closed parser, trusted-answer controller, and oracle proposal-quality economics only; not utterance scoring, open-set or open-world recognition, model performance, protected evaluation, human reliability, ontology truth, authority, action, or execution",
  "visibleMenuContract": {
